@startuml SD_DischargeUser
title SD: UC16 - Discharge SNS User

actor "Nurse" as Nurse
participant ": MainMenu" as UI
participant "nurseController\n: NurseController" as CTRL
participant "globalHC\n: HealthcareCenter" as HC

autonumber

activate Nurse
Nurse -> UI: starts the process to discharge an SNS User
activate UI

UI -> CTRL: getRecoveryRoomUsers()
activate CTRL

CTRL -> HC: getRecoveryRoom()
activate HC
HC --> CTRL: returns recovery room list
deactivate HC

CTRL --> UI: returns recovery room list
deactivate CTRL

UI --> Nurse: shows the list of users in the Recovery Room and requests SNS User Number
deactivate UI

Nurse -> UI: inputs the SNS User Number
activate UI

UI -> CTRL: dischargeUser(snsNumber)
activate CTRL

CTRL -> HC: dischargeUserFromRecoveryRoom(snsNumber)
activate HC

note right of HC
  HC iterates through the recoveryRoom list.
  If a user matches snsNumber, it is erased from the vector.
end note

HC --> CTRL: returns true/false
deactivate HC

CTRL --> UI: returns true/false
deactivate CTRL

alt returns true
    UI --> Nurse: confirms successful discharge
else returns false
    UI --> Nurse: informs error (user not found)
end

deactivate UI
deactivate Nurse
@enduml
